<title>GREECE: Natl Bank of Greece trims savings deposit rate.</title>
<headline>Natl Bank of Greece trims savings deposit rate.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>State National Bank of Greece will lower its savings deposit rate by 25 basis points down to 11.25 percent effective November 4, it said on Friday.</p>
<p>National's checking account depo rates will fall by 25 basis points to 9.75 percent from 10.0 percent currently. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
